---
// Cover.
---
<section id="cover" class="relative flex min-h-svh flex-col">
  <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-1 flex-col justify-center px-5 pt-28 pb-16">
    <p
      class="reveal font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.35em] text-ink-faint uppercase md:text-xs"
    >
      Octopy &middot; A one-person software studio
    </p>

    <h1
      class="reveal mt-6 font-display text-[22vw] leading-[0.9] font-medium tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[16vw] lg:text-[11rem]"
      style="--reveal-delay: 100ms"
    >
      Octopy
    </h1>

    <div class="reveal rule-double mt-10" style="--reveal-delay: 200ms"></div>

    <div
      class="reveal mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between"
      style="--reveal-delay: 280ms"
    >
      <p class="font-display text-2xl font-light tracking-wide text-ink md:text-3xl">
        Annual Report &mdash; Fiscal Year 2026
      </p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-faint uppercase">
        Prepared by the founder &middot; October 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <p
      class="reveal mt-8 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft"
      style="--reveal-delay: 360ms"
    >
      Web applications, server infrastructure, and open-source tools &mdash; designed, built,
      and maintained by one person. This report documents the year in full.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 pb-10">
    <a
      href="#contents"
      class="reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-soft uppercase transition-colors hover:text-ledger"
      style="--reveal-delay: 440ms"
    >
      Open the report <i class="ph ph-arrow-down"></i>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
